  "solution": {
    "text": "White phosphorous dissolves in boiling NaOH solution (in a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math>atmosphere) to give phosphine, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>NaH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>PH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p>",
